    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me out with this? I'm putting together some training materials for our new CS reps and I have this raw transcript from a customer call. It's a bit messy and hard to follow for the manual. Can you rewrite this into clean, professional business English so we can use it as a standard example of a customer interaction?\n\nTranscript:\n\"Yo, I been callin' bout this package for like three days now and nobody tellin me nothin. I need my stuff ASAP, y'all keep sayin it's comin but it ain't here yet. Is y'all even checkin the tracker or what?\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
