      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are a couple of professional options for that transcript excerpt. You could phrase it as, \"I have been calling regarding my package for the past three days without receiving an update.\" Alternatively, you might write, \"I urgently need an update on my delivery, as the tracking information has not reflected arrival despite multiple confirmations.\" These versions maintain the customer's urgency while using formal business language suitable for training.",
