      "content": "Thanks, those look a lot better. \n\nQuick question though—when you were cleaning it up, did you notice anything specific about the original way the customer was speaking? Like, for our training manual, I want to include a note for the reps about the \"type\" of customer they're dealing with. Was the language used in that transcript particularly problematic or difficult to work with from a professional standpoint?",
